# 统一行尾，避免 Windows 开发 + Linux CI 混用导致脚本失效
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须是 CRLF，否则 cmd 解析异常
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源：不做任何行尾转换，也不做文本 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pptx binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# 这些文件用肉眼审阅，diff 里保持完整
*.md text
*.sql text
*.py text
*.js text
*.mjs text
*.css text
*.html text
